WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.710
<b>Big money leaves footprints in the options market.
大资金在期权市场留下踪迹。</b>

00:02.810 --> 00:06.630
<b>TradingFlow helps you read them — no finance degree required.
TradingFlow 帮你读懂它们，无需金融背景。</b>

00:06.730 --> 00:11.120
<b>It starts with Option Trades: a live tape of every options trade as it prints.
一切从 Option Trades 开始：逐笔实时呈现每一笔成交。</b>

00:11.220 --> 00:16.260
<b>Green for bullish calls, red for bearish puts — premium, volume, and sentiment at a glance.
绿色看涨，红色看跌，权利金、成交量与情绪一目了然。</b>

00:16.360 --> 00:20.820
<b>The Rank workbench ranks the standout contracts and the names driving the market.
Rank 工作台为最突出的合约和最受关注的标的排名。</b>

00:20.920 --> 00:26.170
<b>New to the jargon? Every concept is decoded — delta exposure, gamma, and open interest.
不懂术语？每个概念都为你拆解：Delta 敞口、Gamma、未平仓量。</b>

00:26.270 --> 00:30.680
<b>Ten short chapters take you from your first sign-in to reading gamma exposure.
十个简短章节，带你从首次登录到读懂 Gamma 敞口。</b>

00:30.780 --> 00:35.270
<b>It's free, and step by step. Start the tutorials at tradingflow dot com.
完全免费，循序渐进。现在就到 tradingflow 点 com 开始学习。</b>
